<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Designer Holdings cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Designer Holdings cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley has cut its rating on Designer Holdings Ltd to neutral from strong buy, the brokerage firm said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- No further information was released. Analyst Josephine Esquivel was unavailable for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the New York-based sportswear designer closed at 10-5/8 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
